        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Ontological interpretation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A probability, threat, or risk forecast is not an occurrence and is therefore not E5 Event. It is modeled as an E54 Dimension assigned by an E13 Attribute Assignment to an E89 Propositional Object describing a possible vandalism scenario. Only a realized vandalism incident is modeled as E11 Modification, a subclass of E7 Activity, because it is a human action that modifies the monument." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9ca3af;dashed=1;fontColor=#374151;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
